# Everything listed here is excluded from the Vercel deployment bundle.
# Python serverless functions have a 500 MB unpacked size cap, and the ML
# dependencies (scikit-learn, matplotlib, PyMuPDF) eat most of it — so we
# ship only what the running app actually needs.

# Tests and dev tooling — never executed in production
tests/
pytest.ini
requirements-dev.txt
.pytest_cache/
.coverage

# Training data and experiment output — only the trained .joblib matters
data/training/
experiments/

# Design prototypes and internal docs
design-system/
Cosmic scale animation (1)/
*.md

# Runtime logs — the serverless filesystem is read-only anyway
logs/

# Other platforms' deploy config
render.yaml
runtime.txt

# Claude Code internals
.claude/
